    <bpmn:process id="W_W2892" name="W2892. Whistleblower &amp; Fair Treatment (Non-Retaliation) Program Governance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Whistleblower report or program review
Frequency: Event-driven + annual review
Volume: ~10–30 reports/year
Owner: Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Participants: Internal Audit, LR Director, Legal, Ethics Committee
Source: workflow W2892 — Whistleblower &amp; Fair Treatment (Non-Retaliation) Program Governance</bpmn:documentation>
