Responsible (R): Internal Audit
Accountable (A): Audit Committee
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2892_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2892_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2892_Task6" name="Internal Audit/Legal investigates with protection of reporter identity; ensures…">
