Responsible (R): Internal Audit / Legal
Accountable (A): Audit Committee
Duration: Per report</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2892_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2892_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2892_Task7" name="LR Director monitors for retaliation claims; reinforces non-retaliation…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: LR Director monitors for retaliation claims; reinforces non-retaliation culture; reports program metrics to Audit Committee
Responsible (R): LR Director
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2892_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2892_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
